scene:
The picture has two areas, read top to bottom, with no titles or headings.

TOP AREA, the full width: a long horizontal path of five connected blocks joined by arrows pointing left to right, with a small unlabelled envelope at the far left and a small unlabelled screen at the far right (no words next to either). Above the whole path, a thin bracket labelled TODAY: 16 DAYS. The five blocks, in order from left to right, each with one icon and its label:
1. an ochre waiting block with a clock and a person thinking, labelled RULE WAIT 3, drawn with a dashed outline and a pair of scissors cutting it;
2. a long ochre waiting block (the widest block) with a line of small queued documents in front of exactly two seated people at desks, labelled SPECIALIST QUEUE 7, solid outline;
3. a teal block with a wrench and a laptop, labelled BUILD 2;
4. an ochre waiting block with a clock and a pen over a paper, labelled SIGN-OFF WAIT 3, drawn with a dashed outline and a pair of scissors cutting it;
5. a teal block with a rocket, labelled RELEASE 1.
Below the path, one single ochre tag labelled DELEGATED: 16 → 10 DAYS, with two thin lines running up from it, one to block 1 and one to block 4. Inside block 2 itself, in its lower right corner, a small ochre stamp labelled KNOWLEDGE GAP. The DELEGATED tag sits below block 3 (BUILD), and its two lines run from the tag to block 1 and to block 4 along a clear path below the blocks, crossing nothing else.

BOTTOM AREA, split in two halves:
Left half: a thick teal arrow runs straight down from the bottom of block 2 to one confident person holding a closed laptop, standing beside exactly two seated specialists at one desk who are teaching them (three people in total in this half), labelled +1 BILLING ENGINEER.
Right half: five pale, faded person outlines standing behind a closed barrier with a small padlock, labelled TEAM OF 5: DEFERRED. Beside the barrier, three small EMPTY, unticked checkboxes (no tick marks in any of them) with icons only (a globe, a plain handshake, a gavel) showing the conditions still to be met; these boxes carry no text.

TEXT: draw exactly these labels, each once and nothing else: TODAY: 16 DAYS, RULE WAIT 3, SPECIALIST QUEUE 7, BUILD 2, SIGN-OFF WAIT 3, RELEASE 1, DELEGATED: 16 → 10 DAYS, KNOWLEDGE GAP, +1 BILLING ENGINEER, TEAM OF 5: DEFERRED. The envelope, screens, papers and documents carry no writing. No currency symbols anywhere ($, € or other) and no writing on any object. Any other text is a defect.
